  "model": "small",
  "language": "en",
  "text": "6.6 I would like to present an invention which has made the way we organise our work easier. It's a simple invention and most of you have used it. It's a small yellow piece of paper which is known all over the world. It's the Post-It note. A Post-It note is a piece of paper with special glue on the back. Modern Post-It notes can be any colour or shape. Post-It notes are simple to use. You can stick them on anything and the note will stay in place. The notes can be easily removed from any surface. First I am going to talk about the history of this invention. Then I will explain how it has made a difference in our lives.",
